            "review_title": "Review at Titan Sky Lounge",
            "review_text": "Hungduong\n1 contribution\n0\nHUNG\nJan 2020 • Family\nThis sky Lounge looks really nice and the music is so enjoyable. The views look excellent the bar attendants are very friendly.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2020\nBoton Blue Hotel & Spa\nDear Hungduong1234,\n\nWarm greetings from Diamond Sky Lounge.\n\nWe would like to send you a big thank as your awesome review. Hope your entertainment time at Diamond Sky Lounge were truly great and relaxing.\n\nWe are looking forward to seeing you in the near future.\n\nRegards,\nDiamond Sky Lounge team\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
