            "review_title": "Review at Titan Sky Lounge",
            "review_text": "Almog16388\nNha Trang, Vietnam37 contributions\n0\nReally nice entertainment and very friendly staff\nJan 2020 • Solo\nAmazing location with great view of the city and the ocean. Staff was very friendly and helpful, especially the manager, who would go out of her way to make us feel comfortable. Great entertainment options, too. Live DJ, sexy dance, fashion shows etc.\nWritten January 13, 2020\nBoton Blue Hotel & Spa\nDear Almog16388,\n\nWarm greetings from Diamond Sky Lounge.\n\nThank you so much for your great review. We hope you did have an unforgettable time with us at Diamond Sky Lounge. \n\nWe are looking forward to seeing you again soon.\n\nRegards,\nDiamond Sky Lounge team\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
